      },
      "message": "fix(2d): join open contour runs and handle inside corners\n\nDeduplicate XY-coincident picked open runs and weld touching runs end to end in `selection_geometry_impl` so manual edge picks around inside corners offset as continuous chains instead of overrunning adjacent walls. Unify `contour_open` and `contour_run_side` on `offset_run_side`, which keeps the outer sweep boundary past bottleneck notches, classifies acute convex joins via `corner_sector_left`, resolves end-cap ties under arc sag, and drops swallowed normal endpoints on short inside-corner legs.\n\nFixes #2277",
